## Context
Two scopes were conflated. Project coherence (do a project's local rules and
skills contradict or shadow the harness, and why) belongs to the project-level
skills `yawn` (report) and `molt` (act). Whole-harness linting belongs to a
doctor that runs only inside the harness repo, author-called. Running a
harness-wide model pass at every session start in every project is drift.

Today neither `yawn` nor `molt` checks coherence; the only check is the model
prompt that `scripts/on-start-context.sh` emits through
`scripts/prompt-project-coherence.sh` on every session start. No mechanical
lint covers skill text beyond frontmatter and descriptions; the former
`skill-doctor` (removed, ticket 0885) mined git history, not skill text.

Author's checklist for skill text, carried by 1233 and 1234:
- contradiction within or between skills;
- a skill presuming or paraphrasing what another skill does or owns;
- historical justifications;
- ticket numbers or project names;
- SKILL.md over 150 lines (warning, not a hard fail, until the author decides
  otherwise: `rules/authoring-skills.md` splits by exclusivity, not length);
- long Bash or Python heredocs in skill text (scripts belong in `scripts/`).

## Children
- 1230 yawn reports project-versus-harness contradiction, shadowing, repeats
- 1231 molt resolves those findings (blocked by 1230)
- 1232 session start drops the model coherence prompt (blocked by 1230, 1231)
- 1234 skill-text lint test in the harness gate
- 1233 harness-doctor skill, harness-only (blocked by 1234)

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Children closed or consciously dropped
- [ ] Integration review: a `yawn` in one project with local rules (arena)
      reports its reasoned override of the merge-by-PR rule as reasoned, not
      as a conflict; `/harness-doctor` in the harness flags
      `skills/trace-doctor/SKILL.md` (known positive)
- [ ] No window without a coherence check: 1232 lands last
- [ ] Relation to tracker 1127 (skills audit) recorded: 1234's line-count
      warnings are the worklist for further splits after 1131 (closed)
